.PP
use the material IDs of adjacent elements that share a node manifold 

.PP
use initialiser_list<> or something to create little comparitor functions that make the comparisons more readable 

.PP
consider the special case of a multiplicated point in 2D which cannot be a splitboundary 
.RE
