.SS "template<uint32_t dim> int csmp::read_VTU_File (const char * fname, \fBVSet\fP< dim > & vset, \fBModelTopology\fP & topology, bool verbose)"
using \fBVTK_TYPE\fP = int;

.PP
Reads the supplied VTK (XML=\&.vtu) file returning the mesh and associated properties into the \fBVSet\fP\&. \fBModel\fP regions are inferred from 'attribute' or 'region id' named scalar cell variables\&. The region information is returned into a \fBModelTopology\fP object\&. Method returns error codes or 0 if everything went OK\&.

.PP
