.SS "template<uint32_t dim> void csmp::vertexCenterOfMass (const std::vector< \fBPoint\fP< dim > > & vecPoints, \fBPoint\fP< dim > & vecCentroid)\fR [inline]\fP"
Calculates the center of equal masses at the vertices of a planar, closed, convex surface defined by vecPoints\&.
.SH "Input Arguments"
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIvecPoints\fP The points representing the vertices\&.
